4. ACCEPTABLE USE POLICY (AUTHORIZED SECURITY TESTING ONLY)
------------------------------------------------------------
CyberScape provides security inspection, link analysis, QR code forensics,
email header verification, and an authorized-testing Audit feature.

Acceptable use requirements:
  (a) The Audit feature and all scanning modules may ONLY be executed against
      domains, URLs, servers, systems, networks, or digital assets that you
      own or for which you have obtained explicit, verifiable written permission
      from the rightful owner.
  (b) Using CyberScape for unauthorized vulnerability probing, penetration
      attacks, denial-of-service, harassment, fraud, cyber espionage, or any
      unlawful activity is strictly prohibited and constitutes an immediate
      breach of this license as well as applicable cybercrime statutes.


